<title>UK: UK Tudor says optimistic on current trading.</title>
<headline>UK Tudor says optimistic on current trading.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British floor tiles company Tudor Plc said on Friday that based on its current trade so far, it expected that 1997 would be a year of &quot;significant&quot; progress.</p>
</text>
